rm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{MA}_\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{MA}_\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\\)</span> already quantifies over families with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa\">\\(|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa\\)</span>. The former shift to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span> was therefore one cardinal too strong.</li>\n<li>Martin's axiom is independent of ZFC and is commonly studied together with the negation of CH.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4f557645bc9a749","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MA}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{MA}_\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^+","display":false}],"bytes":998,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-martins-axiom.md|58-thm-martins-axiom]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["b4f557645bc9a749","937fc0dd4cc72948"]}